        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add overstripe clamp test to prep_md_striped_create",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add overstripe clamp test to prep_md_striped_create\n\nAdd back lod_prep_md_striped_create_overstripe_clamp_test, covering\nan overstriped LMV_USER_MAGIC request that exceeds mdt_count *\nlod_max_stripes_per_mdt and gets silently clamped down to that limit\nbefore allocating. This case was previously left out of the suite\nbecause it reproduced a heap buffer overflow in\nlod_mdt_alloc_specific() (KASAN slab-out-of-bounds write), now fixed\nunder LU-21227.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I0b919e1a0f05483386381ab03858708cedc7c960\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
